        "approval_date": "2023-02-08",
        "description": {
          "text": "Added clinical study data on plasma p-Tau 181 and updated ARIA-related labeling information (no new indication or population)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sBLA provides for the addition of clinical study data regarding plasma p-Tau 181 to the Clinical Pharmacology (12.2) and Clinical Studies (14) sections of the Prescribing Information (PI). This sBLA also includes revisions throughout the PI (Dosage and Administration [2.1-2.5], Warnings and Precautions [5.1], Adverse Reactions [previously 6.2], and Patient Counseling Information [17]) that provide for updated information with respect to ARIA associated with the use of Aduhelm, clarification and reorganization of information already in the PI, and for consistency in labeling across the drug class. Updates were also made to Clinical Pharmacology [12.6] based on new guidance recommendations for immunogenicity1 and to Use in Specific Populations [8.2]. Revisions were included in the Medication Guide to align with revisions in the PI.",
              "doc_id": "0dcdc0c2-2523-5b52-8cf8-6cf2799e9a09",
              "line": 6
            }
